DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Na sieh mal einer an! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Biste wegen der Party hier?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Nichts wie rein mit dir!

{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Hehehe{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Erst kam {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
und jetzt auch noch {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich bin ja nich' so der Partyhut-
und-Luftballon-Typ, aber so 'ne
Geburtstagsfeier muss schon sein!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Hier, für dich!
Ich habe kein Geschenk...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}A little while ago, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
brought me a gigantic present!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
I have a present too!
I didn't bring a gift.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Qualche tempo fa, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
mi ha portato un regalo gigantesco!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Anch'io ho un regalo!
Non ho un regalo...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Vorhin hat mir {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
'n Riesengeschenk gegeben!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ich habe auch eins!
Geschenk? Oh, oh...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Az önce {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} bana kocaman bir hediye getirdi!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Benim de hediyem var!
Hediye getirmedim.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Non ci pensare!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Mi basta che tu sia qui!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi ho deciso di non arrabbiarmi
per niente al mondo, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I didn't think I'd get you here!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I was
kind of nervous sending the invite!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
So I'm really glad you came!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
You'll love this gift then!
I don't have a good gift.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Anda, si al final te has animado
a venir!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Tenía mis dudas cuando
te envié la invitación...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Pero me alegro de verte!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Tengo una cosa para ti
No traigo nada...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Non pensavo che avresti messo
piede qui!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ero un po' nervosa
quando ho spedito l'invito!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Perciò mi fa piacere che tu sia qui!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ti ho preso un regalo!
Non ho un regalo.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Geleceğini hiç sanmıyordum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Daveti yollarken biraz gerildim!
O yüzden{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} geldiğine çok sevindim!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
O zaman bu hediyeyi seveceksin!
İyi bir hediyem yok.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non è affatto male avervi qui
a fare festa con me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono proprio fortunata!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ho anche un regalo!
Non ho un regalo.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dass so viele Leute meinen
Geburtstag mit mir feiern{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin echt 'n Glückspilz, was?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Hier, ein Geschenk!
Leider hab ich nichts...
